---
interface Props {
  context?: "article" | "architecture";
  lang?: "fr" | "en";
}

const { context = "article", lang = "fr" } = Astro.props;

const copy = {
  fr: {
    ariaLabel:
      "Schéma en deux panneaux, avant et après la règle 102. Dans les deux, le Mac, sur le VLAN 50, ouvre une session SSH vers l'adresse VLAN 10 d'un hôte à deux pattes, et sa demande passe par pfSense. Avant : l'hôte répond directement au Mac par sa patte VLAN 50, sans repasser par pfSense ; pfSense ne voit qu'un sens de la conversation, sa fiche reste à SYN_SENT:CLOSED avec 22 paquets dans un sens et zéro dans l'autre, et il l'oublie après 30 secondes de silence. Après : la réponse repart par la patte VLAN 10 et repasse par pfSense ; la fiche devient ESTABLISHED:ESTABLISHED, avec des paquets dans les deux sens, et elle est gardée 24 heures.",
    avant: "avant : sans la règle 102",
    apres: "après : avec la règle 102",
    pfsense: "pfSense",
    ifaces: "mvneta0.50 │ mvneta0.10",
    mac: "le Mac",
    macIp: "203.0.113.37",
    hote: "l'hôte",
    hote10: "192.0.2.N · VLAN 10",
    hote50: "203.0.113.N · VLAN 50",
    demande: "demande",
    reponse: "réponse",
    directe1: "réponse directe par la patte 50 :",
    directe2: "pfSense ne la voit jamais",
    avantEtat1: "SYN_SENT:CLOSED · 22:0 pkts",
    avantEtat2: "oubliée après 30 s de silence",
    apresEtat1: "ESTABLISHED:ESTABLISHED · 24:17 pkts",
    apresEtat2: "gardée 24 h",
    retour1: "la réponse repasse",
    retour2: "par pfSense",
  },
  en: {
    ariaLabel:
      "Two-panel diagram, before and after rule 102. In both, the Mac, on VLAN 50, opens an SSH session to the VLAN 10 address of a host with two legs, and its request goes through pfSense. Before: the host answers the Mac directly through its VLAN 50 leg, without going back through pfSense; pfSense sees only one direction of the conversation, its state stays at SYN_SENT:CLOSED with 22 packets one way and zero the other, and it forgets it after 30 seconds of silence. After: the reply leaves through the VLAN 10 leg and goes back through pfSense; the state becomes ESTABLISHED:ESTABLISHED, with packets both ways, and it is kept for 24 hours.",
    avant: "before: without rule 102",
    apres: "after: with rule 102",
    pfsense: "pfSense",
    ifaces: "mvneta0.50 │ mvneta0.10",
    mac: "the Mac",
    macIp: "203.0.113.37",
    hote: "the host",
    hote10: "192.0.2.N · VLAN 10",
    hote50: "203.0.113.N · VLAN 50",
    demande: "request",
    reponse: "reply",
    directe1: "direct reply through leg 50:",
    directe2: "pfSense never sees it",
    avantEtat1: "SYN_SENT:CLOSED · 22:0 pkts",
    avantEtat2: "forgotten after 30 s of silence",
    apresEtat1: "ESTABLISHED:ESTABLISHED · 24:17 pkts",
    apresEtat2: "kept 24 h",
    retour1: "the reply goes back",
    retour2: "through pfSense",
  },
} as const;

const t = copy[lang];
---

<figure class="mauvaise-patte-diagram">
  <div class="diagram-wrap">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 390" role="img" aria-label={t.ariaLabel}>
      <defs>
        <marker id="mp-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="var(--text-faint)" />
        </marker>
        <marker id="mp-arrow-live" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="var(--accent-live)" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <line x1="450" y1="16" x2="450" y2="374" stroke="var(--panel-border)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 6" />

      <!-- ===================== AVANT ===================== -->
      <text x="225" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="12.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.avant}</text>

      <rect x="150" y="52" width="150" height="56" rx="4" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--panel-border)" />
      <text x="225" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--text)">{t.pfsense}</text>
      <text x="225" y="94" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.ifaces}</text>
      <text x="225" y="130" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--text)">{t.avantEtat1}</text>
      <text x="225" y="146" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.avantEtat2}</text>

      <rect x="20" y="262" width="120" height="56" rx="4" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--panel-border)" />
      <text x="80" y="285" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--text)">{t.mac}</text>
      <text x="80" y="303" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.macIp}</text>

      <rect x="290" y="252" width="150" height="76" rx="4" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--panel-border)" />
      <text x="365" y="274" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--text)">{t.hote}</text>
      <text x="365" y="293" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9" fill="var(--text)">{t.hote10}</text>
      <text x="365" y="310" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.hote50}</text>

      <!-- la demande : Mac → pfSense → patte 10 -->
      <path d="M80,262 L80,80 L148,80" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-faint)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#mp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M300,80 L400,80 L400,250" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-faint)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#mp-arrow)" />
      <text x="88" y="175" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.demande}</text>

      <!-- la réponse : directement par la patte 50 -->
      <path d="M290,300 L142,300" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-faint)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#mp-arrow)" />
      <text x="216" y="342" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.directe1}</text>
      <text x="216" y="357" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.directe2}</text>

      <!-- ===================== APRÈS ===================== -->
      <text x="675" y="30" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="12.5" font-weight="600" fill="var(--accent-live)">{t.apres}</text>

      <rect x="600" y="52" width="150" height="56" rx="4" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--accent-live)" stroke-width="1.5" />
      <text x="675" y="75" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--text)">{t.pfsense}</text>
      <text x="675" y="94" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="8.5" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.ifaces}</text>
      <text x="675" y="130" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--accent-live)">{t.apresEtat1}</text>
      <text x="675" y="146" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--accent-live)">{t.apresEtat2}</text>

      <rect x="470" y="262" width="120" height="56" rx="4" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--panel-border)" />
      <text x="530" y="285" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--text)">{t.mac}</text>
      <text x="530" y="303" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.macIp}</text>

      <rect x="740" y="252" width="150" height="76" rx="4" fill="var(--panel)" stroke="var(--panel-border)" />
      <text x="815" y="274" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="var(--text)">{t.hote}</text>
      <text x="815" y="293" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9" fill="var(--accent-live)">{t.hote10}</text>
      <text x="815" y="310" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.hote50}</text>

      <!-- la demande, même chemin -->
      <path d="M530,262 L530,72 L598,72" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-faint)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#mp-arrow)" />
      <path d="M750,72 L850,72 L850,250" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-faint)" stroke-width="1.8" marker-end="url(#mp-arrow)" />
      <text x="538" y="175" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--text-faint)">{t.demande}</text>

      <!-- la réponse : patte 10 → pfSense → Mac -->
      <path d="M870,252 L870,94 L752,94" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-live)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#mp-arrow-live)" />
      <path d="M600,94 L512,94 L512,260" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-live)" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="5 4" marker-end="url(#mp-arrow-live)" />
      <text x="506" y="200" text-anchor="end" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--accent-live)">{t.reponse}</text>
      <text x="676" y="342" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--accent-live)">{t.retour1}</text>
      <text x="676" y="357" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--accent-live)">{t.retour2}</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    {
      lang === "en" ? (
        <>
          The same request, the same pfSense, two different ways back. The state counters are the real ones, read with{" "}
          <code>pfctl -ss -vv</code> on September 24, 2026: before the fix on console-vm, after it on vm-02.
          {context === "architecture" && (
            <>
              {" "}See the article: <a href="/blog/la-reponse-par-la-mauvaise-patte/">the reply that left by the wrong leg</a>.
            </>
          )}
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          La même demande, le même pfSense, deux chemins de retour. Les compteurs des fiches sont les vrais, lus avec{" "}
          <code>pfctl -ss -vv</code> le 24 septembre 2026 : avant le correctif sur console-vm, après sur vm-02.
          {context === "architecture" && (
            <>
              {" "}Voir l'article : <a href="/blog/la-reponse-par-la-mauvaise-patte/">la réponse par la mauvaise patte</a>.
            </>
          )}
        </>
      )
    }
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .mauvaise-patte-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .diagram-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--bg);
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    max-width: var(--measure);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  figcaption a {
    color: var(--accent-live);
  }

  figcaption code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    background: var(--panel);
    padding: 0.1em 0.3em;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
</style>
